to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: a run of lower highs and lower lows from 2116.86 (first open) to 1368.42 (bar 13 low), with widening ranges into bars 9-13 (2006.06->1859.02, 1859.01->1813.04, 1813.04->1731.00, 1731.00->1581.32, 1581.32->1568.55).", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779580800000, "upper_boundary": "2139.34"}, {"description": "Selling climax / possible mtr-like low area: bar 13 prints the window low 1368.42 with its close 1568.55 well above that low, and bar 14 reverses to close 1687.83 near its high (high 1690.78) after opening 1568.55.", "end_time_ms": 1780790400000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780617600000, "upper_boundary": "1690.78"}, {"description": "Bull sequence from the window low: rising swing lows 1512.91/1533.12, 1821.49, 2357.18, 2358.62 punctuated by consolidations (about 1512-1725, 1850-1975, 2357-2557); successive bull legs reached 1954.36 (bar 59) and 2771 (bar 89).", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Two-sided trading range after the bar-87..89 spike: overlapping bars between the 2357.18 low (bar 101) and the 2557.46 high (bar 95), with two upside probes that closed back inside \u2014 2680 high closing 2514.72 (bar 110) and 2609.02 high closing 2514.07 (bar 113).", "end_time_ms": 1789689599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Upside breakout attempt from that range: bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, the first closes above the 2557.46 ceiling, with bar 118 printing 2700, the highest high since the 2771 spike of bar 89.", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789603200000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Continuation: additional closes above 2700 with rising closes would indicate acceptance above the range, shifting focus to the 2771 bar-89 spike high.", "Failure: closes back below 2568.16 (bar 119 low) and then 2557.46 would indicate a failed breakout and a return into the 2357.18-2557.46 range.", "A close below 2357.18 would remove the two-sided floor and support a broader range-breakdown or bear-leg read.", "Repeated closes between 2557.46 and 2700 without progress would mark a new, higher trading range rather than a continuation trend."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789948799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The last 30 bars show higher highs (2438.47, 2585.5, 2643.52, 2700) and higher lows (2413.82, 2436.87, 2568.16), which is a bull-trend swing progression rather than range rotation.", "Bars 1789732800000 and 1789747200000 are two strong bull trend bars closing near their highs with little overlap, a spike that can begin a trend.", "The 2700-2568.16 pullback retraced only about 38.6% of the 2358.62-2700 leg and held above its midpoint, a shallow reaction typical of a developing channel.", "The last close is the highest close in the 120-bar window and the final two bars closed in the upper quarter of their ranges, i.e. the recent directional test is unresolved rather than clearly rejected."], "evidence_for": ["Window extremes 2700 and 2357.18 bracket a 342.82-point range with two roughly equal lows (2357.18 and 2358.62) and two roughly equal highs (2680 and 2700), a two-sided outline rather than a clean trend.", "The 2680 spike at bar 1789128000000 (close 2555.52) was fully given back to 2358.62 within 12 bars, showing poor trend follow-through.", "About the first 50-66 bars traded a 2434-2537 sub-range with heavy bar-to-bar overlap and repeated reversals.", "The last close 2642.9 is still below the 2658.79 swing high (bar 1789833600000) and the 2700 window high, so no acceptance above the range top has been recorded."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens 2466.63 (bar 1788220800000) and last closes 2642.9 (bar 1789934400000), net +176.27 across 120 closed 4H bars.", "Window high 2700 (bar 1789804800000) is a 61.51-point upper tail over a 2638.49 close; window low 2357.18 (bar 1788336000000) has a near-equal low 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000), 1.44 apart.", "Range height 342.82; last close sits 285.72 above the low, about 83% of the window range.", "Last close 2642.9 is the highest close in the window; prior maximum close was 2640.01 (bar 1789819200000).", "Bull spike bars 1789732800000 (open 2507.15, high 2585.5, close 2578.6) and 1789747200000 (open 2579.97, high 2643.52, close 2636.28) closed near their highs with little overlap.", "Pullback low 2568.16 (bar 1789891200000) retraced about 38.6% of the 2358.62-2700 leg and held above its 2529.31 midpoint.", "Bars 1789473600000-1789488000000 were two large bear bars (closes 2423.29 and 2412.95, low 2358.62) giving back the prior 2680 spike made at bar 1789128000000 (high 2680, close 2555.52).", "Last three bars close 2611, 2631.93 and 2642.9, with the final two closing in the upper quarter of their ranges."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Broad 120-bar 4H two-sided range: low 2357.18 (bar 1788336000000) with near-equal low 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000); high 2680 (bar 1789128000000) with marginally higher high 2700 (bar 1789804800000). Roughly the first half of the window chopped inside a 2434-2537 sub-range with heavy overlap, and both spikes to the upper boundary were partly or fully retraced.", "end_time_ms": 1789934400000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788220800000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the 2358.62 low (bar 1789488000000): rising lows 2413.82 (1789603200000), 2436.87 (1789689600000), 2568.16 (1789891200000); rising highs 2438.47, 2585.5, 2643.52 (1789747200000) and 2700 (1789804800000). Advance, pullback and resumption so far hold above the leg midpoint 2529.31.", "end_time_ms": 1789934400000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}, {"description": "Bull spike attempt: two consecutive bull trend bars, 1789732800000 (open 2507.15, high 2585.5, close 2578.6) and 1789747200000 (open 2579.97, high 2643.52, close 2636.28), pushing above the prior 2469-2609 area. No close has yet exceeded the 2700 window high.", "end_time_ms": 1789747200000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2495.82", "start_time_ms": 1789732800000, "upper_boundary": "2643.52"}, {"description": "Bull flag after the spik